---
import Eyebrow from '../../ui/Eyebrow.astro';
import Rule from '../../ui/Rule.astro';
import { founder } from '../../../data/founder';
---

<section class="on-bone gutter-x section-y bg-bone text-bone-text">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-measure flex-col gap-8 text-body lg:text-body-lg">
    <Eyebrow tone="bone">About</Eyebrow>

    <p>
      <span class="mb-4 block font-display text-h3-sm font-normal lg:text-lead">
        {founder.fullName} founded Claemont Ridge Law after{' '}
        {founder.yearsInPractice} years at [PRIOR FIRM 1] and [PRIOR FIRM 2],
        where he advised technology companies, agencies and established
        businesses on the agreements their operations depended on.
      </span>
      [He grew up in / has practised in] [CITY/REGION] and has appeared in its
      courts throughout his career. He opened his own office because he wanted to
      run a practice in which the person a client meets on the first day is the
      person who carries their matter to the end.
    </p>

    <p class="text-bone-muted">
      [Placeholder paragraph two, roughly 70 words, describing how he works with
      clients: how he explains options, how he handles urgency, what a client can
      expect from the first conversation. This should read as observation about
      him, not a list of services. It stays in the third person and avoids
      adjectives that praise him; the specifics do that work on their own.]
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 py-6">
      <Rule tone="bone" />
      <blockquote class="text-quote-sm font-light italic lg:text-h2">
        “{founder.bioQuote}”
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <p class="text-bone-muted">
      [Placeholder paragraph three, roughly 60 words, covering his commercial
      work: the kinds of businesses he advises, how he approaches drafting and
      negotiation, and his view on fixed fees. One concrete example of a typical
      engagement helps here, anonymised.]
    </p>

    <p class="text-bone-muted">
      [Placeholder paragraph four, roughly 40 words: something outside the office.
      Where he lives, a long-standing involvement in the community, or how he
      spends time away from work. One or two sentences, plainly stated.]
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
